  "title": "Persimmon Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "The heady combination of persimmon and chocolate come together in this persimmon chocolate chip cookie recipe. Choose overripe fruit for best results.",
  "authors": [
    "Natalie Ercolini"
  ],
